    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This magically reinforced wooden shield (Hardness 6, HP 36, BT 18) normally has a blank face. It can absorb a staff and transform between a shield and staff. When you prepare a staff, you can hold it up to the shield, at which point the items merge until your next daily preparations, and the shield's face becomes an image corresponding to the type of magic, such as a skull for a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "staff of the dead",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
